  "body_html": "<h1>dubinsSpanierProportional</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem dubinsSpanierProportional (n : ℕ) (hn : 0 &lt; n) (μ : Fin n → Measure I) [∀ i, IsFiniteMeasure (μ i)] [∀ i, NoAtoms (μ i)] : ∃ A : Allocation (Fin n) I, IsAllocation A ∧ IsProportional n (MeasureValuation μ) A</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Allocation</li>\n<li>IsEnvyFree.isProportional</li>\n<li>IsProportional</li>\n<li>MeasureValuation</li>\n</ul>",
